<title>UK: Skikda port still closed - port official.</title>
<headline>Skikda port still closed - port official.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's port of Skikda was still closed on Wednesday because of bad weather, a port official said.</p>
<p>The port closed on Tuesday morning and the official said the weather was still bad on Wednesday afternoon. He did not know when it would reopen.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
